@startuml MERN_Auth_Activity

title MERN Authentication System - Streamlined User Journey

|#LightBlue|User|
start
:Access Authentication App;
note right: Landing page with login/signup options

|#LightGreen|Authentication Flow|
if (Has Account?) then (no)
  :Register New Account;
  note right
    • Validate input (Joi)
    • Check email uniqueness
    • Hash password (bcrypt)
    • Send welcome email
  end note
  
  |Backend System|
  :Create User & Generate Tokens;
  :Set Secure Cookies + Track Session;
else (yes)
  :Login with Credentials;
  note right
    • Validate credentials
    • Check account lock status
    • Handle failed attempts (5 max)
  end note
endif

|Backend System|
:Authentication Validation;

if (Authentication Success?) then (no)
  |User|
  :Show Error & Stop;
  stop
else (yes)
  if (MFA Enabled?) then (yes)
    |User|
    :Complete MFA Verification;
    note right
      TOTP/Backup Code
      via Speakeasy
    end note
  endif
  
  :Generate JWT Tokens & Set Cookies;
  :Track Device Session;
endif

|#LightYellow|Dashboard & Features|
|User|
:Access Protected Dashboard;

fork
  :Email Verification;
  note right
    • Generate & send OTP
    • Validate within 15min
    • Mark account verified
  end note
fork again
  :Profile Management;
  note right
    • Update user info
    • Validate changes
    • Save to MongoDB
  end note
fork again
  :MFA Setup;
  note right
    • Generate TOTP secret
    • Create QR code
    • Generate backup codes
  end note
fork again
  :Password Reset;
  note right
    • OTP via email
    • Validate & hash new password
    • Invalidate all tokens
  end note
fork again
  :Session Management;
  note right
    • View active sessions
    • Revoke sessions
    • Track device info
  end note
endfork

|#LightCyan|Alternative Auth|
if (OAuth Login?) then (yes)
  |OAuth Provider|
  :OAuth Flow (Google/GitHub);
  note right
    • Redirect to provider
    • Get authorization
    • Exchange for user data
  end note
  
  |Backend System|
  :Link/Create Account & Generate Tokens;
endif

|#LightPink|Session Management|
fork
  :Token Refresh Cycle;
  note right
    • Check token expiry
    • Auto-refresh if valid
    • Redirect to login if expired
  end note
fork again
  :Secure Logout;
  note right
    • Clear cookies
    • Invalidate tokens
    • Remove session
  end note
endfork

:End Session;
stop

@enduml
